docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth
  `POST /api/v1/invites/links/:token/join` — Authenticated user; Bearer access token required.
  ## Description
  Joins the authenticated user to the group using a valid invitation token and password.
  ## Request
  ### Path Parameters
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `token` | `string` | Yes | Invitation token from `token` or `invite_url`. |
  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |
  ### Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `password` | `string` | Yes | Password configured for the invitation. |
  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Weekend trip",
      "created_by_user_id": 7,
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "is_premium": false,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "member_count": 3,
      "members": []
    }
  }
  ```
  ## Errors
  - `400 INVITE_JOIN_PAYLOAD_INVALID` — Password is missing or body is invalid.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `401 INVITE_PASSWORD_INVALID` — Invitation password is incorrect.
  - `404 INVITE_NOT_FOUND` — Token does not match an invitation.
  - `409 ALREADY_GROUP_MEMBER` — User is already an active member.
  - `409 GROUP_INACTIVE` — Group cannot accept new members.
  - `410 INVITE_DEACTIVATED` — Invitation has been revoked.
  - `410 INVITE_EXPIRED` — Invitation has expired.
  - `410 INVITE_USES_EXHAUSTED` — Invitation reached its use limit.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Group membership could not be created.
}
